ading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"2326afe3-b048-48e6-a250-2aa7c572dcc4"},{"content":"<system_reminder>\nUse the following current-turn intent and routing guidance when deciding whether to create or update todos. Treat it as planning context, not as a user request.\n<hidden_step source=\"intent_recognition\" title=\"意图识别\">\n改写后的任务：列出当前前端授权范围内可用的技能能力\n</hidden_step>\n<hidden_step source=\"skill_router\" title=\"SkillRouter 路由\">\n路由原因：No intent scene for scene skill filter\n</hidden_step>\n</system_reminder>","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"todo_routing_guidance","id":"e6542e57-42b9-4a11-940e-85c40f5d150d"},{"content":"好的，我先对这段本地视频做一帧基础检测，看看当前能提取到什么客观信息，然后逐一评估你提到的四项需求。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":266,"prompt_tokens":10625,"total_tokens":10891,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":137,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":266},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10625}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-6fc85a89-177a-9e3f-bc00-ec8a7101a8e6","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9df8-2442-7413-90d8-af6f8e8abc7f-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"video_object_analytics","args":{"operation":"detect","video_path":"/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4","capture_seconds":2,"interval_seconds":1,"labels":"person,car,truck,bus"},"id":"call_df6f7b1c2fad4f37b00695a1","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":106