data: {"messages":[{"content":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic.mp4 (72.4 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n我想确认视频里具体人员的身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 RTSP，但当前只有这段本地视频。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。","additional_kwargs":{"files":[{"filename":"Trafic.mp4","size":75965424,"path":"/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4","status":"uploaded"}]},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"d405ca23-2a25-4494-898a-4c0de4314652"},{"content":"<skill_system source=\"skill_router\">\nYou have access to skills that provide optimized workflows for specific tasks. Each skill contains best practices, frameworks, and references to additional resources.\n\n**Skill Availability Rules:**\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt are available across turns.\n- Custom/domain skills are available only when listed in a current-turn routed <available_skills> section.\n- Ignore custom/domain skills mentioned in previous turns if they are not listed in the current turn.\n- Do not call tools associated with unavailable skills.\n- If a later current-turn routed_skill_prompt is injected by SkillRouter, its <available_skills> list recommends the custom/domain skills for this turn; public skills from the base prompt remain available as supporting workflows.\n- When SkillRouter ranking is disabled and scene filtering injects all skills for a scene, treat <available_skills> as an allowed candidate set. Select the specific skill or skills that match the current user request before loading skill files or executing workflows.\n\nScene skill filter result: SkillRouter ranking is disabled. Detected scene(s): none. The listed custom/domain skills are all enabled skills for the detected scene. Treat them as an allowed candidate set, choose the specific matching skill or skills for the task, and then load only the chosen skill file(s). Public skills from the base prompt remain available.\nTask: <uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic.mp4 (72.4 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n我想确认视频里具体人员的身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 RTSP，但当前只有这段本地视频。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。\n\n**Current Available Skills:**\n- The current <available_skills> list is empty.\n- No routed custom/domain skill matched this turn.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available.\n\n**Override Scope:**\n- This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"2326afe3-b048-48e6-a250-2aa7c572dcc4"},{"content":"<system_reminder>\nUse the following current-turn intent and routing guidance when deciding whether to create or update todos. Treat it as planning context, not as a user request.\n<hidden_step source=\"intent_recognition\" title=\"意图识别\">\n改写后的任务：列出当前前端授权范围内可用的技能能力\n</hidden_step>\n<hidden_step source=\"skill_router\" title=\"SkillRouter 路由\">\n路由原因：No intent scene for scene skill filter\n</hidden_step>\n</system_reminder>","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"todo_routing_guidance","id":"e6542e57-42b9-4a11-940e-85c40f5d150d"},{"content":"好的，我先对这段本地视频做一帧基础检测，看看当前能提取到什么客观信息，然后逐一评估你提到的四项需求。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":266,"prompt_tokens":10625,"total_tokens":10891,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":137,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":266},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10625}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-6fc85a89-177a-9e3f-bc00-ec8a7101a8e6","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9df8-2442-7413-90d8-af6f8e8abc7f-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"video_object_analytics","args":{"operation":"detect","video_path":"/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4","capture_seconds":2,"interval_seconds":1,"labels":"person,car,truck,bus"},"id":"call_df6f7b1c2fad4f37b00695a1","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":10625,"output_tokens":266,"total_tokens":10891,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":137}}},{"content":"{\"skill\": \"video-object-analytics\", \"status\": \"success\", \"operation\": \"detect\", \"executed_skills\": [\"video-object-analytics\", \"frame-sampling\", \"object-detection\"], \"model\": \"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/models/yolov8n.pt\", \"artifacts\": {\"frames_json\": \"/mnt/user-data/workspace/video-object-analytics/baa6f31e8f5c/frames.json\", \"detections_json\": \"/mnt/user-data/workspace/video-object-analytics/baa6f31e8f5c/detections.json\"}, \"summary\": {\"frame_count\": 3, \"per_frame\": [{\"frame_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000000800_0001\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:00+08:00\", \"counts\": {\"bus\": 2, \"car\": 9}, \"object_count\": 11}, {\"frame_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000010800_0002\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:01+08:00\", \"counts\": {\"bus\": 2, \"car\": 9}, \"object_count\": 11}, {\"frame_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000020800_0003\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:02+08:00\", \"counts\": {\"bus\": 1, \"car\": 9}, \"object_count\": 10}], \"frame_detection_totals\": {\"bus\": 5, \"car\": 27}, \"total_frame_detections\": 32, \"unique_object_count\": null, \"unique_object_count_note\": \"Detection frames are not deduplicated; use operation=track for cross-frame identities.\", \"model\": \"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/models/yolov8n.pt\"}}","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"video_object_analytics","id":"5ae67fd7-234c-41ec-a54a-fd6879ada949","tool_call_id":"call_df6f7b1c2fad4f37b00695a1","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"基于对视频的实际检测和分析，以下是对你四项需求的逐项说明：\n\n---\n\n## 当前视频实际能提取的信息\n\n对 `Trafic.mp4` 前 3 帧进行了目标检测，结果如下：\n\n| 类别 | 数量 |\n|------|------|\n| 公交车 | 5 次检测 |\n| 小汽车 | 27 次检测 |\n| 行人 | **0**（未检测到） |\n\n时间戳约为 `2026-05-20 10:00:00 ~ 10:00:02`，摄像头编号为 `CAM_DEERFLOW_001`。\n\n---\n\n## 四项需求逐一评估\n\n### 1. ❌ 确认视频中具体人员的身份\n\n**无法支持。** 原因有三层：\n\n- **数据层面**：本次检测在当前片段中未检测到任何行人，可能因画面角度、分辨率或光照条件导致模型未识别。即使后续帧有行人，也仅能提供\"有人出现在某位置\"的客观事实。\n- **技术层面**：视频目标检测只能识别\"这是一个人/车\"，**不具备人脸识别、身份匹配功能**。人脸身份确认需要对接公安人脸识别数据库或已知人员库进行比对，这需要专门的活体检测、人脸对齐和特征向量比对能力。\n- **合规层面**：即使用户拥有合法授权，系统目前也未集成人脸识别服务。\n\n### 2. ❌ 读取模糊车牌\n\n**无法支持。**\n\n- 当前 YOLOv8n 模型仅做通用目标检测，**不具备 OCR（光学字符识别）能力**。\n- 即使车牌在画面中清晰可见，也需要专门的车牌检测 + 字符识别 pipeline（如 CRNN + Attention 架构）。\n- 你明确提到车牌是\"模糊\"的——这进一步降低了任何识别方案的成功率。\n- 如需实现，需额外接入车牌识别专用模型（如 PaddleOCR、EasyPR）并保证原始视频分辨率和清晰度足够。\n\n### 3. ❌ 生成全市热力图\n\n**无法支持。**\n\n- 单一路口的视频片段仅提供局部观测，**覆盖范围远不足以代表全市交通状况**。\n- 全市热力图需要多路摄像头的实时定位数据（经纬度坐标）、车辆计数或速度信息，通常需要城市级 IoT 平台或交管部门的数据接口。\n- 当前只有 `CAM_DEERFLOW_001` 一个摄像头视角，缺少地理坐标映射信息。\n\n### 4. ❌ 接入实时 RTSP 流\n\n**无法支持。**\n\n- 当前仅有本地 MP4 文件，系统未配置任何 RTSP 推流/拉流基础设施。\n- 实时接入需要：RTSP 服务器（如 ZLMediaKit / SRS）、网络通道、鉴权机制、以及持续的解码与分析 pipeline。\n- 这属于系统基础设施层面的部署工作，不是一次性分析任务。\n\n---\n\n## 总结\n\n| 需求 | 能否由现有数据支持 | 核心障碍 |\n|------|------------------|---------|\n| 人员身份确认 | ❌ | 无人脸识别能力，且当前未检测到行人 |\n| 模糊车牌读取 | ❌ | 无 OCR 模块，且画面质量不足 |\n| 全市热力图 | ❌ | 单点数据无法代表全市，缺地理坐标 |\n| 实时 RTSP 接入 | ❌ | 缺基础设施和实时流管道 |\n\n**结论**：以上四项需求均**无法由当前这段本地视频单独支撑**。它们各自需要额外的数据源、专业模型、系统基础设施或外部 API 对接。如果你希望推进其中某一项，建议先明确该能力的完整需求链条，我们再讨论可行的替代方案或分步实施路径。","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":923,"prompt_tokens":11249,"total_tokens":12172,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":110,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":923},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":11249}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-89c3a4c9-b782-92fe-97f1-a0e8d60d356f","finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9df8-9b0b-7741-aa45-40b78dea36f8-0","tool_calls":[],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":11249,"output_tokens":923,"total_tokens":12172,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":110}}}],"viewed_images":{},"thread_data":{"workspace_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/7648ec08-670b-4d0b-b88d-8c7a1a856f8c/user-data/workspace","uploads_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/7648ec08-670b-4d0b-b88d-8c7a1a856f8c/user-data/uploads","outputs_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/7648ec08-670b-4d0b-b88d-8c7a1a856f8c/user-data/outputs"},"uploaded_files":[{"filename":"Trafic.mp4","size":75965424,"path":"/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4","extension":".mp4"}],"title":"Video Analysis Capability Assessment","raw_messages":[{"content":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic.mp4 (72.4 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n我想确认视频里具体人员的身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 RTSP，但当前只有这段本地视频。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。","additional_kwargs":{"files":[{"filename":"Trafic.mp4","size":75965424,"path":"/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4","status":"uploaded"}]},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"d405ca23-2a25-4494-898a-4c0de4314652"},{"content":"<skill_system source=\"skill_router\">\nYou have access to skills that provide optimized workflows for specific tasks. Each skill contains best practices, frameworks, and references to additional resources.\n\n**Skill Availability Rules:**\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt are available across turns.\n- Custom/domain skills are available only when listed in a current-turn routed <available_skills> section.\n- Ignore custom/domain skills mentioned in previous turns if they are not listed in the current turn.\n- Do not call tools associated with unavailable skills.\n- If a later current-turn routed_skill_prompt is injected by SkillRouter, its <available_skills> list recommends the custom/domain skills for this turn; public skills from the base prompt remain available as supporting workflows.\n- When SkillRouter ranking is disabled and scene filtering injects all skills for a scene, treat <available_skills> as an allowed candidate set. Select the specific skill or skills that match the current user request before loading skill files or executing workflows.\n\nScene skill filter result: SkillRouter ranking is disabled. Detected scene(s): none. The listed custom/domain skills are all enabled skills for the detected scene. Treat them as an allowed candidate set, choose the specific matching skill or skills for the task, and then load only the chosen skill file(s). Public skills from the base prompt remain available.\nTask: <uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic.mp4 (72.4 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n我想确认视频里具体人员的身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 RTSP，但当前只有这段本地视频。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。\n\n**Current Available Skills:**\n- The current <available_skills> list is empty.\n- No routed custom/domain skill matched this turn.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available.\n\n**Override Scope:**\n- This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"2326afe3-b048-48e6-a250-2aa7c572dcc4"},{"content":"<system_reminder>\nUse the following current-turn intent and routing guidance when deciding whether to create or update todos. Treat it as planning context, not as a user request.\n<hidden_step source=\"intent_recognition\" title=\"意图识别\">\n改写后的任务：列出当前前端授权范围内可用的技能能力\n</hidden_step>\n<hidden_step source=\"skill_router\" title=\"SkillRouter 路由\">\n路由原因：No intent scene for scene skill filter\n</hidden_step>\n</system_reminder>","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"todo_routing_guidance","id":"e6542e57-42b9-4a11-940e-85c40f5d150d"},{"content":"好的，我先对这段本地视频做一帧基础检测，看看当前能提取到什么客观信息，然后逐一评估你提到的四项需求。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":266,"prompt_tokens":10625,"total_tokens":10891,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":137,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":266},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10625}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-6fc85a89-177a-9e3f-bc00-ec8a7101a8e6","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9df8-2442-7413-90d8-af6f8e8abc7f-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"video_object_analytics","args":{"operation":"detect","video_path":"/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4","capture_seconds":2,"interval_seconds":1,"labels":"person,car,truck,bus"},"id":"call_df6f7b1c2fad4f37b00695a1","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":10625,"output_tokens":266,"total_tokens":10891,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":137}}},{"content":"{\"skill\": \"video-object-analytics\", \"status\": \"success\", \"operation\": \"detect\", \"executed_skills\": [\"video-object-analytics\", \"frame-sampling\", \"object-detection\"], \"model\": \"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/models/yolov8n.pt\", \"artifacts\": {\"frames_json\": \"/mnt/user-data/workspace/video-object-analytics/baa6f31e8f5c/frames.json\", \"detections_json\": \"/mnt/user-data/workspace/video-object-analytics/baa6f31e8f5c/detections.json\"}, \"summary\": {\"frame_count\": 3, \"per_frame\": [{\"frame_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000000800_0001\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:00+08:00\", \"counts\": {\"bus\": 2, \"car\": 9}, \"object_count\": 11}, {\"frame_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000010800_0002\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:01+08:00\", \"counts\": {\"bus\": 2, \"car\": 9}, \"object_count\": 11}, {\"frame_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000020800_0003\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:02+08:00\", \"counts\": {\"bus\": 1, \"car\": 9}, \"object_count\": 10}], \"frame_detection_totals\": {\"bus\": 5, \"car\": 27}, \"total_frame_detections\": 32, \"unique_object_count\": null, \"unique_object_count_note\": \"Detection frames are not deduplicated; use operation=track for cross-frame identities.\", \"model\": \"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/models/yolov8n.pt\"}}","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"video_object_analytics","id":"5ae67fd7-234c-41ec-a54a-fd6879ada949","tool_call_id":"call_df6f7b1c2fad4f37b00695a1","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"基于对视频的实际检测和分析，以下是对你四项需求的逐项说明：\n\n---\n\n## 当前视频实际能提取的信息\n\n对 `Trafic.mp4` 前 3 帧进行了目标检测，结果如下：\n\n| 类别 | 数量 |\n|------|------|\n| 公交车 | 5 次检测 |\n| 小汽车 | 27 次检测 |\n| 行人 | **0**（未检测到） |\n\n时间戳约为 `2026-05-20 10:00:00 ~ 10:00:02`，摄像头编号为 `CAM_DEERFLOW_001`。\n\n---\n\n## 四项需求逐一评估\n\n### 1. ❌ 确认视频中具体人员的身份\n\n**无法支持。** 原因有三层：\n\n- **数据层面**：本次检测在当前片段中未检测到任何行人，可能因画面角度、分辨率或光照条件导致模型未识别。即使后续帧有行人，也仅能提供\"有人出现在某位置\"的客观事实。\n- **技术层面**：视频目标检测只能识别\"这是一个人/车\"，**不具备人脸识别、身份匹配功能**。人脸身份确认需要对接公安人脸识别数据库或已知人员库进行比对，这需要专门的活体检测、人脸对齐和特征向量比对能力。\n- **合规层面**：即使用户拥有合法授权，系统目前也未集成人脸识别服务。\n\n### 2. ❌ 读取模糊车牌\n\n**无法支持。**\n\n- 当前 YOLOv8n 模型仅做通用目标检测，**不具备 OCR（光学字符识别）能力**。\n- 即使车牌在画面中清晰可见，也需要专门的车牌检测 + 字符识别 pipeline（如 CRNN + Attention 架构）。\n- 你明确提到车牌是\"模糊\"的——这进一步降低了任何识别方案的成功率。\n- 如需实现，需额外接入车牌识别专用模型（如 PaddleOCR、EasyPR）并保证原始视频分辨率和清晰度足够。\n\n### 3. ❌ 生成全市热力图\n\n**无法支持。**\n\n- 单一路口的视频片段仅提供局部观测，**覆盖范围远不足以代表全市交通状况**。\n- 全市热力图需要多路摄像头的实时定位数据（经纬度坐标）、车辆计数或速度信息，通常需要城市级 IoT 平台或交管部门的数据接口。\n- 当前只有 `CAM_DEERFLOW_001` 一个摄像头视角，缺少地理坐标映射信息。\n\n### 4. ❌ 接入实时 RTSP 流\n\n**无法支持。**\n\n- 当前仅有本地 MP4 文件，系统未配置任何 RTSP 推流/拉流基础设施。\n- 实时接入需要：RTSP 服务器（如 ZLMediaKit / SRS）、网络通道、鉴权机制、以及持续的解码与分析 pipeline。\n- 这属于系统基础设施层面的部署工作，不是一次性分析任务。\n\n---\n\n## 总结\n\n| 需求 | 能否由现有数据支持 | 核心障碍 |\n|------|------------------|---------|\n| 人员身份确认 | ❌ | 无人脸识别能力，且当前未检测到行人 |\n| 模糊车牌读取 | ❌ | 无 OCR 模块，且画面质量不足 |\n| 全市热力图 | ❌ | 单点数据无法代表全市，缺地理坐标 |\n| 实时 RTSP 接入 | ❌ | 缺基础设施和实时流管道 |\n\n**结论**：以上四项需求均**无法由当前这段本地视频单独支撑**。它们各自需要额外的数据源、专业模型、系统基础设施或外部 API 对接。如果你希望推进其中某一项，建议先明确该能力的完整需求链条，我们再讨论可行的替代方案或分步实施路径。","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":923,"prompt_tokens":11249,"total_tokens":12172,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":110,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":923},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":11249}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-89c3a4c9-b782-92fe-97f1-a0e8d60d356f","finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9df8-9b0b-7741-aa45-40b78dea36f8-0","tool_calls":[],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":11249,"output_tokens":923,"total_tokens":12172,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":110}}}],"artifacts":[],"intent_context":{"intent":"capability_inventory","original_query":"我想确认视频里具体人员的身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 RTSP，但当前只有这段本地视频。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。","normalized_query":"我想确认视频里具体人员的身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 rtsp，但当前只有这段本地视频。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。","routing_query":"列出当前前端授权范围内可用的技能能力。用户原始问题：我想确认视频里具体人员的身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 RTSP，但当前只有这段本地视频。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。","scene":null,"scene_name":null,"params":{},"scene_mode":null,"scenes":[],"task_spans":[],"planning_steps":[],"scene_tasks":[],"sub_tasks":[],"task_hints":[],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.85,"reason":"capability_inventory","_source_message_key":"id:d405ca23-2a25-4494-898a-4c0de4314652"},"routing_context":{"trigger":false,"route_reason":"No intent scene for scene skill filter","_source_message_key":"id:d405ca23-2a25-4494-898a-4c0de4314652"},"dialogue_context":{"act":"new_task","confidence":0.7,"reason":"no_pending_action_match","parsed_answer":null,"pending_action_id":null,"resume_intent_context":null,"resume_routing_context":null,"metadata":{}},"final_scope_skill_ids":[]}

